@page "/"

<PageTitle>Inicio | DVD's La Huesera</PageTitle>

<div class="home">

    <style>
            @@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');

            .home {
                --red: #e63946;
                --bg: #0c0c0e;
                --surface: #19191e;
                --muted: #99999f;
                background: var(--bg);
                color: #f5f5f5;
                font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
                margin: -16px;
                overflow: hidden;
            }

            .home * { box-sizing: border-box; }
            .home a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }

            /* NAVBAR */

            .navbar {
                min-height: 82px;
                padding: 0 8%;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: space-between;
                border-bottom: 1px solid #ffffff12;
            }

            .brand {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 11px;
                font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
                font-size: 19px;
                font-weight: 700;
                letter-spacing: 1px;
            }

            .brand-icon {
                width: 36px;
                height: 36px;
                background: var(--red);
                display: grid;
                place-items: center;
                border-radius: 9px;
            }

            .brand-dot { color: var(--red); }

            .nav-links {
                display: flex;
                gap: 35px;
            }

            .nav-links a {
                color: var(--muted);
                font-size: 13px;
                transition: .3s;
            }

            .nav-links a:hover { color: white; }

            .login-btn {
                padding: 12px 19px;
                border: 1px solid #ffffff30;
                border-radius: 7px;
                font-size: 13px;
                font-weight: 600;
            }

            .login-btn:hover {
                background: var(--red);
                border-color: var(--red);
            }

            /* HERO */

            .hero {
                min-height: 630px;
                padding: 80px 10%;
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: 1.1fr .9fr;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 50px;
            }

            .hero-content { max-width: 590px; }

            .hero-label, .section-label {
                color: var(--red);
                font-size: 11px;
                font-weight: 800;
                letter-spacing: 2px;
            }

            .live-dot {
                display: inline-block;
                width: 7px;
                height: 7px;
                background: var(--red);
                border-radius: 50%;
                margin-right: 8px;
                box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--red);
            }

            .hero h1 {
                font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
                font-size: clamp(42px, 5vw, 67px);
                line-height: 1.12;
                letter-spacing: -3px;
                margin: 25px 0;
            }

            .hero h1 span,
            .section-heading h2 span,
            .about-content h2 span {
                color: var(--red);
            }

            .hero-description {
                color: var(--muted);
                font-size: 15px;
                line-height: 1.9;
                max-width: 480px;
            }

            .hero-actions {
                display: flex;
                gap: 15px;
                margin-top: 32px;
            }

            .primary-btn, .secondary-btn {
                display: inline-flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                gap: 15px;
                padding: 15px 22px;
                border-radius: 7px;
                font-size: 13px;
                font-weight: 700;
                transition: .3s;
            }

            .primary-btn {
                background: var(--red);
                color: white !important;
            }

            .primary-btn:hover {
                background: #c92d3a;
                transform: translateY(-3px);
            }

            .secondary-btn { border: 1px solid #ffffff30; }

            .secondary-btn:hover { background: #ffffff12; }

            .hero-stats {
                display: flex;
                gap: 30px;
                margin-top: 65px;
                padding-top: 25px;
                border-top: 1px solid #ffffff18;
            }

            .hero-stats div {
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 6px;
            }

            .hero-stats strong {
                font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
                font-size: 22px;
                color: var(--red);
            }

            .hero-stats span {
                color: var(--muted);
                font-size: 11px;
            }

            /* POSTER */

            .hero-visual {
                height: 440px;
                position: relative;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
            }

            .visual-glow {
                position: absolute;
                width: 330px;
                height: 330px;
                border-radius: 50%;
                background: var(--red);
                filter: blur(130px);
                opacity: .2;
            }

            .main-poster {
                position: relative;
                z-index: 1;
                width: 270px;
                height: 365px;
                padding: 17px;
                background: linear-gradient(145deg, #29292f, #101013);
                border: 1px solid #ffffff30;
                border-radius: 5px;
                box-shadow: 25px 30px 70px #00000090;
                transform: rotate(-5deg);
            }

            .poster-top {
                display: flex;
                justify-content: space-between;
                color: #aaa;
                font-size: 7px;
                letter-spacing: 1px;
            }

            .poster-art {
                height: 205px;
                margin-top: 15px;
                background: radial-gradient(circle, #9d2935, #30151d 60%, #100f12);
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                position: relative;
                overflow: hidden;
            }

            .poster-circle {
                position: absolute;
                width: 165px;
                height: 165px;
                border: 1px solid #ffffff40;
                border-radius: 50%;
            }

            .poster-silhouette {
                font-size: 55px;
                color: #ffffffb0;
            }

            .poster-bottom {
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                margin-top: 17px;
                gap: 3px;
            }

            .poster-bottom span {
                font-size: 8px;
                letter-spacing: 2px;
                color: #bbb;
                margin-bottom: 7px;
            }

            .poster-bottom strong {
                font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
                font-size: 19px;
            }

            .floating-card {
                position: absolute;
                z-index: 2;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 12px;
                padding: 14px 18px;
                border: 1px solid #ffffff20;
                background: #1a1a20ee;
                border-radius: 9px;
                box-shadow: 0 15px 40px #00000060;
            }

            .floating-top { top: 55px; right: 0; }
            .floating-bottom { bottom: 55px; left: -15px; }

            .floating-icon { color: var(--red); font-size: 23px; }

            .floating-card div {
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 4px;
            }

            .floating-card strong { font-size: 11px; }
            .floating-card small { font-size: 10px; color: var(--muted); }

            /* MARQUEE */

            .marquee {
                padding: 21px 5%;
                display: flex;
                justify-content: space-around;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 20px;
                background: var(--red);
                color: white;
                font-size: 11px;
                font-weight: 800;
                letter-spacing: 2px;
            }

            /* CATALOG */

            .catalog-section, .services-section { padding: 105px 10%; }

            .section-heading {
                display: flex;
                align-items: end;
                justify-content: space-between;
                margin-bottom: 45px;
            }

            .section-heading h2, .about-content h2 {
                font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
                font-size: 40px;
                letter-spacing: -1.5px;
                margin: 12px 0 0;
            }

            .text-link {
                color: var(--red) !important;
                font-size: 13px;
                font-weight: 700;
                padding-bottom: 8px;
            }

            .movie-grid {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
                gap: 22px;
            }

            .movie-card { min-width: 0; }

            .movie-poster {
                height: 310px;
                border-radius: 8px;
                padding: 15px;
                position: relative;
                overflow: hidden;
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                justify-content: space-between;
                transition: .35s;
            }

            .movie-card:hover .movie-poster { transform: translateY(-7px); }

            .poster-one { background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 35%, #256080, #0c1b2b 70%); }
            .poster-two { background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 40%, #368d9b, #102a40 70%); }
            .poster-three { background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 40%, #a64b44, #2d1820 75%); }
            .poster-four { background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 40%, #d68b37, #422b20 75%); }

            .movie-tag {
                width: fit-content;
                background: #00000065;
                padding: 6px 9px;
                border-radius: 3px;
                font-size: 9px;
                font-weight: 700;
                letter-spacing: 1px;
            }

            .movie-art {
                text-align: center;
                font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
                font-weight: 700;
                font-size: 27px;
                text-shadow: 0 4px 15px #000;
                letter-spacing: 2px;
            }

            .movie-number { font-size: 10px; color: #ffffff80; }

            .movie-info {
                display: flex;
                justify-content: space-between;
                align-items: center;
                padding: 15px 2px;
            }

            .movie-info h3 { font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 5px; }
            .movie-info p { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); margin: 0; }
            .movie-arrow { color: var(--red); font-size: 19px; }

            /* SERVICES */

            .services-section { background: #121215; }

            .centered {
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: center;
                text-align: center;
            }

            .centered p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; margin-top: 15px; }

            .services-grid {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
                gap: 20px;
                margin-top: 50px;
            }

            .service-card {
                background: #19191e;
                padding: 30px;
                border: 1px solid #ffffff12;
                border-radius: 9px;
                transition: .3s;
            }

            .service-card:hover {
                border-color: var(--red);
                transform: translateY(-5px);
            }

            .featured-service {
                border-color: #e6394650;
                background: linear-gradient(145deg, #29191d, #19191e);
            }

            .service-icon {
                width: 48px;
                height: 48px;
                background: #e639461c;
                color: var(--red);
                display: grid;
                place-items: center;
                border-radius: 9px;
                font-size: 25px;
                margin-bottom: 25px;
            }

            .service-card > span {
                font-size: 10px;
                color: var(--red);
                font-weight: 700;
            }

            .service-card h3 {
                font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
                font-size: 21px;
                margin: 12px 0;
            }

            .service-card p {
                color: var(--muted);
                font-size: 13px;
                line-height: 1.8;
            }

            /* ABOUT */

            .about-section {
                padding: 100px 12%;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: space-between;
                gap: 40px;
                background: linear-gradient(100deg, #1d1115, #0c0c0e);
                position: relative;
                overflow: hidden;
            }

            .about-content { position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 600px; }

            .about-content h2 { font-size: 43px; margin: 18px 0; }

            .about-content p {
                color: var(--muted);
                font-size: 14px;
                line-height: 2;
                margin-bottom: 28px;
            }

            .about-decoration {
                font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
                font-size: clamp(100px, 18vw, 230px);
                font-weight: 700;
                color: #ffffff08;
                transform: rotate(-15deg);
                user-select: none;
            }

            /* FOOTER */

            .footer {
                padding: 35px 8%;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: space-between;
                border-top: 1px solid #ffffff15;
                gap: 20px;
            }

            .footer p, .back-top { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); }
            .back-top:hover { color: var(--red); }

            /* RESPONSIVE */

            @@media (max-width: 950px) {
                .hero { padding: 70px 6%; gap: 20px; }
                .movie-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
                .nav-links { gap: 15px; }
            }

            @@media (max-width: 650px) {
                .navbar {
                    padding: 15px 5%;
                    flex-wrap: wrap;
                    gap: 18px;
                }

                .nav-links {
                    order: 3;
                    width: 100%;
                    justify-content: space-between;
                    gap: 8px;
                }

                .nav-links a { font-size: 11px; }
                .login-btn { padding: 10px; font-size: 11px; }

                .hero {
                    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                    padding: 65px 7%;
                }

                .hero h1 { font-size: 43px; letter-spacing: -2px; }
                .hero-visual { height: 400px; }
                .hero-stats { gap: 15px; margin-top: 40px; }
                .hero-stats span { font-size: 9px; }

                .floating-top { right: -5px; }
                .floating-bottom { left: -5px; }

                .marquee { font-size: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }

                .catalog-section, .services-section { padding: 70px 6%; }

                .section-heading {
                    flex-direction: column;
                    align-items: start;
                    gap: 20px;
                }

                .section-heading h2 { font-size: 32px; }
                .movie-grid { gap: 13px; }
                .movie-poster { height: 230px; }
                .movie-art { font-size: 20px; }
                .services-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }

                .about-section { padding: 75px 7%; }
                .about-decoration { display: none; }
                .about-content h2 { font-size: 34px; }

                .footer {
                    flex-direction: column;
                    text-align: center;
                }
            }
    </style>

    <!-- NAVBAR -->
    <nav class="navbar">
        <a href="/" class="brand">
            <span class="brand-icon">▶</span>
            <span>LA HUESERA<span class="brand-dot">.</span></span>
        </a>

        <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="#inicio">Inicio</a>
            <a href="#catalogo">Películas</a>
            <a href="#servicios">Servicios</a>
            <a href="#nosotros">Nosotros</a>
        </div>

        <a href="/login" class="login-btn">Iniciar sesión ↗</a>
    </nav>

    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="hero" id="inicio">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <div class="hero-label">
                <span class="live-dot"></span>
                TU VIDEOTIENDA DE CONFIANZA
            </div>

            <h1>
                Las mejores historias
                <span>merecen una pantalla.</span>
            </h1>

            <p class="hero-description">
                En DVD's La Huesera encontrarás películas para todos los gustos.
                Elige tu favorita, solicita tu préstamo y disfruta del cine
                como más te gusta.
            </p>

            <div class="hero-actions">
                <a href="#catalogo" class="primary-btn">
                    Explorar películas →
                </a>
                <a href="#nosotros" class="secondary-btn">
                    Conócenos
                </a>
            </div>

            <div class="hero-stats">
                <div><strong>01</strong><span>Elige tu película</span></div>
                <div><strong>02</strong><span>Solicita tu préstamo</span></div>
                <div><strong>03</strong><span>Disfruta del cine</span></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-visual">
            <div class="visual-glow"></div>

            <div class="main-poster">
                <div class="poster-top">
                    <span>LA HUESERA COLLECTION</span>
                    <span>DVD · 001</span>
                </div>

                <div class="poster-art">
                    <div class="poster-circle"></div>
                    <div class="poster-silhouette">▶</div>
                </div>

                <div class="poster-bottom">
                    <span>EL CINE TE ESPERA</span>
                    <strong>UNA HISTORIA.</strong>
                    <strong>MIL EMOCIONES.</strong>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="floating-card floating-top">
                <span class="floating-icon">✦</span>
                <div>
                    <strong>Tu próxima película</strong>
                    <small>Está aquí</small>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="floating-card floating-bottom">
                <span class="floating-icon">▣</span>
                <div>
                    <strong>Préstamos fáciles</strong>
                    <small>Rápido y sencillo</small>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- MARQUEE -->
    <div class="marquee">
        <span>🎬 EL CINE NUNCA PASA DE MODA</span>
        <span>✦ GRANDES HISTORIAS</span>
        <span>🎬 MOMENTOS INOLVIDABLES</span>
    </div>

    <!-- CATALOGO -->
    <section class="catalog-section" id="catalogo">
        <div class="section-heading">
            <div>
                <span class="section-label">DESCUBRE TU PRÓXIMA HISTORIA</span>
                <h2>Películas <span>destacadas.</span></h2>
            </div>
            <a href="/peliculas" class="text-link">
                Ver catálogo completo →
            </a>
        </div>

        <div class="movie-grid">

            <article class="movie-card">
                <div class="movie-poster poster-one">
                    <span class="movie-tag">ACCIÓN</span>
                    <div class="movie-art">MATRIX</div>
                    <span class="movie-number">01</span>
                </div>
                <div class="movie-info">
                    <div><h3>Matrix</h3><p>Ciencia ficción · 1999</p></div>
                    <span class="movie-arrow">↗</span>
                </div>
            </article>

            <article class="movie-card">
                <div class="movie-poster poster-two">
                    <span class="movie-tag">AVENTURA</span>
                    <div class="movie-art">AVATAR</div>
                    <span class="movie-number">02</span>
                </div>
                <div class="movie-info">
                    <div><h3>Avatar</h3><p>Ciencia ficción · 2009</p></div>
                    <span class="movie-arrow">↗</span>
                </div>
            </article>

            <article class="movie-card">
                <div class="movie-poster poster-three">
                    <span class="movie-tag">DRAMA</span>
                    <div class="movie-art">TITANIC</div>
                    <span class="movie-number">03</span>
                </div>
                <div class="movie-info">
                    <div><h3>Titanic</h3><p>Romance · 1997</p></div>
                    <span class="movie-arrow">↗</span>
                </div>
            </article>

            <article class="movie-card">
                <div class="movie-poster poster-four">
                    <span class="movie-tag">ANIMACIÓN</span>
                    <div class="movie-art">TOY STORY</div>
                    <span class="movie-number">04</span>
                </div>
                <div class="movie-info">
                    <div><h3>Toy Story</h3><p>Animación · 1995</p></div>
                    <span class="movie-arrow">↗</span>
                </div>
            </article>

        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SERVICIOS -->
    <section class="services-section" id="servicios">
        <div class="section-heading centered">
            <span class="section-label">UNA EXPERIENCIA SENCILLA</span>
            <h2>El cine está a <span>tu alcance.</span></h2>
            <p>Todo lo que necesitas para encontrar y disfrutar tu próxima película.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="services-grid">
            <article class="service-card">
                <div class="service-icon">⌕</div>
                <span>01</span>
                <h3>Encuentra</h3>
                <p>Busca tus películas favoritas por nombre o código y consulta su disponibilidad.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="service-card featured-service">
                <div class="service-icon">▣</div>
                <span>02</span>
                <h3>Solicita</h3>
                <p>Realiza tus préstamos de manera sencilla y lleva el entretenimiento a casa.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="service-card">
                <div class="service-icon">↩</div>
                <span>03</span>
                <h3>Devuelve</h3>
                <p>Gestiona la devolución de tus películas y permite que otros disfruten de ellas.</p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- NOSOTROS -->
    <section class="about-section" id="nosotros">
        <div class="about-content">
            <span class="section-label">SOBRE NOSOTROS</span>
            <h2>Más que películas,<br /><span>historias que compartir.</span></h2>
            <p>
                DVD's La Huesera es una videotienda pensada para los amantes
                del cine. Nuestro objetivo es facilitar la búsqueda, el préstamo
                y la devolución de películas, brindando una experiencia práctica
                y organizada.
            </p>
            <a href="#catalogo" class="primary-btn">
                Descubre el catálogo →
            </a>
        </div>

        <div class="about-decoration">DVD</div>
    </section>

    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <footer class="footer">
        <a href="/" class="brand">
            <span class="brand-icon">▶</span>
            <span>LA HUESERA<span class="brand-dot">.</span></span>
        </a>

        <p>© 2026 DVD's La Huesera. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>

        <a href="#inicio" class="back-top">Volver arriba ↑</a>
    </footer>

</div>
